# Project: NexusTickets
## Stack Overview
- **Backend**: Go (Fiber v2 + GORM + Wire) → REST API + JWT auth + WebSocket (gorilla/websocket)
- **Database**: PostgreSQL 16 (primary) + Redis 7 (cache / sessions / pub-sub)
- **Frontend**: React 19 + Vite 6 + Bun + TypeScript + Tailwind CSS v4 + shadcn/ui + Lucide React + React Router v7 + Redux Toolkit + RTK Query
- **Auth**: JWT (access + refresh tokens), role-based (admin / organizer / attendee / guest)
- **Realtime**: WebSocket for messaging (requirement 10) — gorilla/websocket on backend, native WebSocket API on frontend

## Assignment Requirements Checklist
> Every feature must trace back to a requirement number.

- **Req 1**: Welcome page — login + register, SSL/TLS
- **Req 2**: Registration form — username, password, confirm password, first name, last name, email, phone, address, geo location, VAT number. Username uniqueness check. Redirect to pending page after submit.
- **Req 3**: Seeded admin user. Admin login → user management page.
- **Req 4**: Admin: list users, view user details, approve/reject registrations.
- **Req 5**: Registered user login → home/events page.
- **Req 6**: Home page → event management OR event browse/search.
- **Req 7**: Event management — create (DTD schema), browse own events + their bookings, edit/cancel/delete with rules, capacity + ticket type management.
- **Req 8**: Event browse/search — by category, title, description (full-text), date range, price, location. Paginated results.
- **Req 9**: Event detail — OpenStreetMap embed, booking form with confirmation dialog, availability checks, update available count after booking.
- **Req 10**: Post-booking messaging — realtime WebSocket chat, inbox/sent organization, unread indicator in navbar, delete messages, bulk cancel notification.
- **Req 11**: Guest can browse/search but cannot book.
- **Req 12**: Admin XML export (matching DTD) + JSON export.
- **Req 13**: Biased Matrix Factorization recommendation engine, from scratch, cold-start fallback.

